          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Kirkland Signature Whey is the better powder for most Costco members: leaner, isolate-led and, at typical member prices, among the cheapest wheys in the warehouse. Elevation by Millville is the better buy for everyone else: no membership, a smaller tub, a bigger 30 g serving and, in the 2 lb size, a cost per 25 g that few powders anywhere can beat.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
